This model does not have any documentation and is awaiting confirmation of the
origin of the MSL data for validation purposes.

Included here are 4 color-plots:
- Table_data.png               a straightforward plot of the table data
- World_Map_TableData.png      a shifted plot of the table data to the
                               conventional world view, with zero longitude in
                               the middle; the eye more naturally picks out the
                               continents in this image.
- Geoid_Altitude_TableData.png a map of the height-above-sea-level of the
                               zero-altitude Geoid with data taken from the
                               table.  This is the negative of Table_data.png.
- Geoid_Altitude_simData.png   a map of the height-above-sea-level of the
                               zero-altitude Geoid with data taken from
                               RUN_sweep in the verification sim.
                               Comparison against Geoid_Altitude_TableData.png
                               confirms that the model is using the data table
                               as expected.
